#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QCheckBox, chkDisableDoubleBuffering)
#: ui/forms/wdgdisplaysettings.ui:206
msgid ""
"<html><head/><body><p>Try to disable double buffering. This makes painting "
"more responsive, but might cause crashes with some ATI GPU/driver "
"combinations.</p></body></html>"
msgstr ""
"<html><head/><body><p>Pokušajte onemogućiti dvostruko baferovanje. To čini "
"da slikanje ima bolji odziv , ali može uzrokovati krah s nekim ATI GPU / "
"kombinacijama drajvera.</p></body></html>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, chkDisableDoubleBuffering)
#: ui/forms/wdgdisplaysettings.ui:209
