#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QCheckBox, chkDisableVsync)
#: ui/forms/wdgdisplaysettings.ui:252
msgid ""
"<html><head/><body><p>Try to disable vsync for Krita. This makes painting "
"more responsive. Uncheck only when experiencing crashes with some GPU/driver "
"combinations.</p></body></html>"
msgstr ""
"<html><head/><body><p>Pokušajte onemogućiti vsync za Krita . To čini da "
"slikanje ima bolji odziv. Uklonite oznaku samo kada doživljavate krahove s "
"nekim kombinacijama GPU/drajver.</p></body></html>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, chkDisableVsync)
#: ui/forms/wdgdisplaysettings.ui:255
